  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Offered to the market for the first time in nearly 40 years, this is a rare opportunity to secure a home in the heart of sought-after Milford, with exciting potential to add value in a location that is always in demand.\r\n\r\nJust a 300m walk from Milford Beach, and a short stroll to local cafés, shops and Milford Mall, with Takapuna only minutes away, the lifestyle on offer is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nSet across two levels, the home features a practical layout with generous upstairs living. The open-plan kitchen, dining and lounge flow onto a north-east-facing deck, perfect for enjoying the morning sun or relaxing with a coffee. The master bedroom also enjoys direct deck access, along with its own ensuite and wardrobe space.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, two further bedrooms are supported by a family bathroom with a bath and separate shower, a separate toilet, dedicated laundry and internal-access single garage.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road, the property enjoys a quiet and private lawn area, providing a lovely outdoor setting. Established gardens add to the appeal, while the home itself offers plenty of scope to modernise, refresh and make your own.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to create your next family home, take on a rewarding renovation or secure an investment in a desirable coastal location, the potential here is easy to see.\r\n\r\nA fantastic location, a home full of possibilities and an opportunity to make your mark in Milford.",
